% EXCERPT SOURCE for documentation/appendix_C_line_mask.md -- row 37, r27-cut-apx.
%% Each block is the FULL paragraph as it stood before the cut (pristine v4.27
%% plus the Phase-1 / r27-cut-results records it depends on). Macros must be
